(uses its terminology where there is a direct correspondence. Where the implementation) Tj T*
(requires a somewhat different structure than that used by the formal grammar, new terms that) Tj T*
(mimic the closest existing terms are used. Thus, it really helps to have a copy of RFC 5322) Tj T*
(handy when studying this code. Input to the parser is a string that has already been) Tj T*
