(interpreter shutdown. When invoked without arguments: if this thread already owns the lock,) Tj T*
(increment the recursion level by one, and return immediately. Otherwise, if another thread) Tj T*
(owns the lock, block until the lock is unlocked. Once the lock is unlocked \(not owned by any) Tj T*
(thread\), then grab ownership, set the recursion level to one, and return. If more than one) Tj T*
(thread is blocked waiting until the lock is unlocked, only one at a time will be able to) Tj T*
